@startuml
title S-CORE Integration View with Vehicle Evidence Layer

package "S-CORE" {
  [S-CORE Modules]
  [S-CORE Communication]
  [S-CORE Logging]
  [S-CORE Persistency]
}

package "Vehicle Evidence Layer" {
  [Source Collectors]
  [Evidence Processing]
  [Evidence Persistence]
  [Vehicle Evidence Publisher]
  [VEL Health Publisher]
  [Collection and Audit Logging]
}

[S-CORE Modules] --> [Source Collectors] : exposed module states
[Source Collectors] --> [Evidence Processing] : collected records
[Evidence Processing] ..> [S-CORE Communication] : applicable communication profile
[Evidence Processing] ..> [S-CORE Persistency] : configured evidence persistence
[Evidence Processing] --> [Evidence Persistence] : optional storage
[Evidence Processing] --> [Vehicle Evidence Publisher] : normalized evidence
[Evidence Processing] --> [VEL Health Publisher] : collection status
[Collection and Audit Logging] --> [S-CORE Logging] : collection/audit logs

note bottom of [Vehicle Evidence Publisher]
Vehicle Evidence Layer exposes evidence only.
No control or final OEM decisions.
end note
@enduml
